{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet","id":780017,"title":"How long will the Kickstarter for C20 be open and is it even open yet?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-04T12:09:53-08:00","id":780017,"title":"How long will the Kickstarter for C20 be open and is it even open yet?","content":"Like it says. I want in if I can get in.<br /> <br /> Thanks for any and all help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T12:19:23-08:00","id":780032,"title":"","content":"Onyx Path usually runs their Kickstarters for about 30 days. There was one, Wraith 20 I think, that went a bit longer because of how the 30 day mark would have overlapped Christmas.<br /> <br /> We don't know exactly when the it'll start yet. According to the most recent Monday Meeting blog post, they're aiming to have it go live sometime next week. There are a number of unforeseeable things that could happen to push the start date back a bit though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T05:07:53-08:00","id":782232,"title":"","content":"We have a date and time now!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rich Thomas</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Going live at 12 noon EST US on Dec 10th\u2026the Changeling: the Dreaming 20th Anniversary Deluxe Edition Kickstarter!</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/why-not-an-onyx-throne-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/why-not-an-onyx-throne-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> Why Not an Onyx Throne? [Monday Meeting Notes] &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/why-not-an-onyx-throne-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/why-not-an-onyx-throne-monday-meeting-notes/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T05:42:05-08:00","id":782246,"title":"","content":"Have we heard at all whether the rough draft will be available to backers?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:courier\">REALITY.SYS corrupt. Reboot Universe? Y/N/Q</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/230-taichara","name":"taichara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar230_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T05:53:35-08:00","id":782252,"title":"","content":"I think I remember reading somewhere that excepts might be available but not the entire thing. I can't find a source though, so I could be wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T07:52:54-08:00","id":782300,"title":"","content":"X20 editions have never provided the full text in the KS. Only books that followed the X20 book and some of the nWoD hardbacks did that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T13:05:30-08:00","id":782452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=782300#post782300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">X20 editions have never provided the full text in the KS. Only books that followed the X20 book and some of the nWoD hardbacks did that.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> DA20 had full text.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T13:51:28-08:00","id":782478,"title":"","content":"Onyx Path has consistently been moving towards releasing the full almost done manuscripts for all their Kickstarters. It's not entirely fair to generalize when most of the X20 core books came before OP started moving in that direction (which was also somewhat in response to feedback to their KS campaigns). After the relatively large delays with some of the early KS campaigns, having the manuscripts posted was a way to demonstrate that the books were mostly written, and any delays were in the actual process of making a premium deluxe book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T18:37:13-08:00","id":782574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=782452#post782452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> DA20 had full text.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was considering that more of an add-on, but fair enough. Only one, so it's not a high probability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T19:48:56-08:00","id":782589,"title":"","content":"The more important question is how long will it take for people to get their copies of the book when it is completed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1381-herkles","name":"herkles","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T19:57:42-08:00","id":782590,"title":"","content":"Most pod books ship about 4-5 days after ordering and what you want to pay for shipping determines the speed","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T20:06:02-08:00","id":782593,"title":"","content":"<i>Puts on his math hat</i><br /> <br /> Ok. So there's been 13 OP KS since they first started putting manuscripts in the campaign (Hunters Hunted II). So, V20, and W20 are out of the running in this consideration.<br /> <br /> 6 of those are X20 supplements, all of which got manuscripts.<br /> 3 are nWOD books (one in the 1e style of game line core books requiring the 1e nWOD core book, one a full 2e stand alone core book, and one supplement), all of which got manuscripts.<br /> 1 is Exalted 3e (which the devs were highly insistent on not doing this even as the WOD devs were moving towards it).<br /> <br /> So we're down to three X20 full sized core books. M20 (also the earliest of this cluster) didn't get anything like this. VDA20 got a full manuscript. Wr20 got sample sections but not a full manuscript.<br /> <br /> So that's 2/3s we don't get a full manuscript, and 2/3s we see some preview material of the pre-edited text; if we ignore the trend clearly towards trying to have them. Though three data points that are all different isn't exactly much to go one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T20:12:49-08:00","id":782594,"title":"","content":"I think Rich mentioned sample sections a few Monday meetings ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T21:04:13-08:00","id":782604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=782478#post782478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Onyx Path has consistently been moving towards releasing the full almost done manuscripts for all their Kickstarters. It's not entirely fair to generalize when most of the X20 core books came before OP started moving in that direction (which was also somewhat in response to feedback to their KS campaigns). After the relatively large delays with some of the early KS campaigns, having the manuscripts posted was a way to demonstrate that the books were mostly written, and any delays were in the actual process of making a premium deluxe book.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's not true at all? Da20 is the only 20line book that had a full manuscript before hand. Many of the classic/aniversary line books have come out before and after Mage and Wraith which had full manuscripts(Lore of clans, anarchs unbound etc)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T21:10:14-08:00","id":782609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=782604#post782604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That's not true at all? Da20 is the only 20line book that had a full manuscript before hand. Many of the classic/aniversary line books have come out before and after Mage and Wraith which had full manuscripts(Lore of clans, anarchs unbound etc)</div> </div> </div> </div>You completely missed his post on #12","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T12:13:21-08:00","id":783569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=780032#post780032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Onyx Path usually runs their Kickstarters for about 30 days. There was one, Wraith 20 I think, that went a bit longer because of how the 30 day mark would have overlapped Christmas.<br /> <br /> We don't know exactly when the it'll start yet. According to the most recent Monday Meeting blog post, they're aiming to have it go live sometime next week. There are a number of unforeseeable things that could happen to push the start date back a bit though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will the Kickstarter still be open on Jan. 14th 2016? I've reasons for waiting until after Christmas to spend over 100 dollars on a book which I won't see for a year or two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T12:55:52-08:00","id":783595,"title":"","content":"Well, looks like C20 is heading down the same path as Wr20 where we're not getting the full manuscript, but selections from it will be up as the campaign progresses.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783569#post783569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will the Kickstarter still be open on Jan. 14th 2016? I've reasons for waiting until after Christmas to spend over 100 dollars on a book which I won't see for a year or two.</div> </div> </div> </div>No. If my math is right, it should be ending the 12th. So if there's two days make a difference... not sure there's much to do.<br /> <br /> Though keep in mind, even if you back today, you don't get charged until the campaign is over. So unless your financial situation is going to change significantly over those few days, it shouldn't matter if you back today.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T14:34:58-08:00","id":783663,"title":"","content":"Kickstarter gives you a grace period. You've got five or six days to make good on your pledge and pay after the KS closes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Luka Carroll</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer &amp; Developer<br /> <i>Working On: </i>C20 Player's Guide, Lunars<br /> <i>Worked On: </i>V20 TMR, Demon STG, C20, Book of Freeholds, Conquering Heroes, Building A Legend, Dragon-Blooded, The Realm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3785-luka-c","name":"Luka C","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3785_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T17:25:53-08:00","id":783776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783595#post783595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Well, looks like C20 is heading down the same path as Wr20 where we're not getting the full manuscript, but selections from it will be up as the campaign progresses.</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not happy with this as it reminds me of Wraith 20. I had a bad feeling when Wraith went to KS without a full manuscript and zero artwork done for it, there'd be problems--despite being told otherwise.<br /> <br /> Well...there were huge problems.<br /> <br /> With no art completed for Changeling(unlike Werewolf or Mage 20), and no full manuscript, this doesn't give me a good feeling either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T18:07:22-08:00","id":783806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783776#post783776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not happy with this as it reminds me of Wraith 20. I had a bad feeling when Wraith went to KS without a full manuscript and zero artwork done for it, there'd be problems--despite being told otherwise.<br /> <br /> Well...there were huge problems.<br /> <br /> With no art completed for Changeling(unlike Werewolf or Mage 20), and no full manuscript, this doesn't give me a good feeling either.</div> </div> </div> </div>At least it won't turn out like ex3 right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T19:02:48-08:00","id":783843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783806#post783806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> At least it won't turn out like ex3 right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Different team, and a different kind of project.<br /> <br /> And seriously, anybody who feels uncomfortable about any aspect of our KSs: please don't back them unless backing them will be fun for you. If you are going to worry and fret and not have fun as the process happens, then don't do it. We really don't want anybody to back unless they are comfortable with the idea that they are enabling us to do some _things_ we want to accomplish, and that in order to do those things the way we want to do them, it might take time.<br /> <br /> In the case of Wraith20, we want to create a new and definitive version of Wraith helmed by Rich Dansky, so in order to have Rich we have to wait until his full-time day gig allows him the time to write and develop Wr20. Other projects have other issues, and still others roll along just fine. Or at least any of the issues they have don't impact the estimated delivery date.<br /> <br /> You only need to look at the KS'd projects we have delivered to see how awesome their quality is, and we have not failed to deliver a KS edition yet. So you will get a gorgeous edition and some really cool Stretch Goal rewards. If getting cool stuff is what works for you, then our KSs should be right up your alley. If you need the delivery of that stuff to hit the estimates and you worry until it does or doesn't, and that ruins the fun for you (because some folks actually get fun from the worrying, too), then maybe you'd be better off passing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T19:38:34-08:00","id":783866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783843#post783843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In the case of Wraith20, we want to create a new and definitive version of Wraith helmed by Rich Dansky, so in order to have Rich we have to wait until his full-time day gig allows him the time to write and develop Wr20.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait what? Did you know this was going to be an issue before the kick starter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T19:49:45-08:00","id":783872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783866#post783866\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait what? Did you know this was going to be an issue before the kick starter?</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you a backer of the Wraith20 KS? Because I have explained how Rich's original estimate of the time to finish the text was screwed over by an increased demand on his time with his day job in numerous Updates and comments on the Wr20 KS.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T21:52:52-08:00","id":783930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783872#post783872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are you a backer of the Wraith20 KS? Because I have explained how Rich's original estimate of the time to finish the text was screwed over by an increased demand on his time with his day job in numerous Updates and comments on the Wr20 KS.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe I am and maybe I am not but so far OP is 0-3 in my book on kick starters so I don't plan on backing C20. Maybe the next X20 book though, would that be Hunter, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T22:38:43-08:00","id":783941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783930#post783930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe I am and maybe I am not but so far OP is 0-3 in my book on kick starters so I don't plan on backing C20. Maybe the next X20 book though, would that be Hunter, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm curious how they've failed for you. I've backed several of their projects, including the 20th Anniversery games, and I've greatly enjoyed the transparency and honesty Onyx Path has had with me and other backers.<br /> <br /> Of course, I'm patient.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T01:23:33-08:00","id":783997,"title":"","content":"Yeah...<br /> <br /> There's certainly been delays (some obnoxiously long delays, that as far as I can tell nobody - backer and creator alike - are/were happy about)... but Onyx Path has 18 Kickstarter campaigns now.<br /> <br /> 10 have fully delivered.<br /> 1 is still waiting on the deluxe book, but has the PDF and POD out.<br /> 3 have their backer PDFs out and are in progress towards finalization.<br /> 3 haven't gotten to the backer PDF stage (Wr20, nWOD Dark Eras, and W20 Shattered Dreams which just finished).<br /> 1 just started its funding drive.<br /> <br /> Unless they get zeros for failure to avoid some arbitrarily decided level of acceptable amount of delays, it's pretty hard to slam them with a zero on any of them","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T06:14:24-08:00","id":784111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783997#post783997\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unless they get zeros for failure to avoid some arbitrarily decided level of acceptable amount of delays, it's pretty hard to slam them with a zero on any of them</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd slam them with zeroes in regards to their planning and ability to meet a schedule(Wraith, especially), but I wouldn't dare give a &quot;0&quot; for any finished product.<br /> <br /> They may take a long time to get finished, but they're certainly great final products for the most part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T09:52:39-08:00","id":784225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=784111#post784111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd slam them with zeroes in regards to their planning and ability to meet a schedule(Wraith, especially), but I wouldn't dare give a &quot;0&quot; for any finished product.<br /> <br /> They may take a long time to get finished, but they're certainly great final products for the most part.</div> </div> </div> </div>And there you go. Any Wraith backer has the full story of why Wraith is late: it was Rich's day job that changed the amount of extra time he could devote to Wraith20. The only way to get it in before the estimated KS delivery date would have been to fire Rich Dansky and find someone else who could have done as good a job (hah!). Which it looks like I should have done in order to get a &quot;passing grade&quot; from you. Sorry, not sorry.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T10:33:15-08:00","id":784237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=784225#post784225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And there you go. Any Wraith backer has the full story of why Wraith is late: it was Rich's day job that changed the amount of extra time he could devote to Wraith20. The only way to get it in before the estimated KS delivery date would have been to fire Rich Dansky and find someone else who could have done as good a job (hah!). Which it looks like I should have done in order to get a &quot;passing grade&quot; from you. Sorry, not sorry.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, is this directed at me? Rich, while I would've liked to see Wraith 20 delivered on time, I'm in no way supporting finding someone else to do the job. Dansky is a great writer, and I'd rather it get done &quot;right,&quot; than done on time.<br /> <br /> As a company, Onyx Path gets an &quot;A&quot; from me. That's passing.<br /> <br /> I guess I simply would've been happier if more was written before the time of the actual Kickstarter. Even if the KS was delayed quite a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T12:39:28-08:00","id":784292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maggie C</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=783663#post783663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kickstarter gives you a grace period. You've got five or six days to make good on your pledge and pay after the KS closes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you saying that, as long as I have the money in the Bank by Jan 14th for them to collect, it is Okay. I can buy in around the 6th and it's all good?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T12:46:19-08:00","id":784299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=784292#post784292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are you saying that, as long as I have the money in the Bank by Jan 14th for them to collect, it is Okay. I can buy in around the 6th and it's all good?</div> </div> </div> </div>As long as you don't forget to pledge, you should be OK. It's not a guarantee that you can fix the payment after the 12th, because we don't know how KS's money partner will be functioning then, but other people have been OK fixing their payments a few days after KS tried to collect at the end of a Kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T12:48:49-08:00","id":784303,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=784237#post784237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait, is this directed at me? Rich, while I would've liked to see Wraith 20 delivered on time, I'm in no way supporting finding someone else to do the job. Dansky is a great writer, and I'd rather it get done &quot;right,&quot; than done on time.<br /> <br /> As a company, Onyx Path gets an &quot;A&quot; from me. That's passing.<br /> <br /> I guess I simply would've been happier if more was written before the time of the actual Kickstarter. Even if the KS was delayed quite a while.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool then, thanks. When we do KSs is based on a crap-ton of logistic issues that include our ability to run different KSs and the availability of the creative teams for that time slot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T12:52:13-08:00","id":784306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=784299#post784299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As long as you don't forget to pledge, you should be OK. It's not a guarantee that you can fix the payment after the 12th, because we don't know how KS's money partner will be functioning then, but other people have been OK fixing their payments a few days after KS tried to collect at the end of a Kickstarter.</div> </div> </div> </div>I won't forget to pledge. I'm madly greedy for this book. It's second in my heart after the Mage 20th, and a very close second at that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T13:05:31-08:00","id":784312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=784306#post784306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I won't forget to pledge. I'm madly greedy for this book. It's second in my heart after the Mage 20th, and a very close second at that.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I have a prepaid credit card. We don't typically load the funds on it until the Kickstarter is over, to avoid losing &quot;account maintenance&quot; fees on the balance. As I said above, KS has always given us five or six days' grace period to finalize our payment. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Luka Carroll</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer &amp; Developer<br /> <i>Working On: </i>C20 Player's Guide, Lunars<br /> <i>Worked On: </i>V20 TMR, Demon STG, C20, Book of Freeholds, Conquering Heroes, Building A Legend, Dragon-Blooded, The Realm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3785-luka-c","name":"Luka C","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3785_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T14:28:04-08:00","id":784354,"title":"","content":"Without a look at the manuscript, I'm kind of leery about supporting the Kickstarter. Matt McFarland's last two, Demon: the Descent and Beast, have heavily leaned towards powergaming (powers like starting PCs stopping time or doing aggravated damage over a whole area, weak antagonists, generally massive advantages with few disadvantages). I decided not to support Beast for that reason. It's already been stated that the magic system will become more powerful, and Unleashing from DA: Fae will be included. I hope that the pendulum doesn't swing so far in the other direction that life in the WoD becomes easy for Changelings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1460-tau-neutrino","name":"Tau Neutrino","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1460_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T17:33:27-08:00","id":784431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tau Neutrino</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780017-how-long-will-the-kickstarter-for-c20-be-open-and-is-it-even-open-yet?p=784354#post784354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Without a look at the manuscript, I'm kind of leery about supporting the Kickstarter. Matt McFarland's last two, Demon: the Descent and Beast, have heavily leaned towards powergaming (powers like starting PCs stopping time or doing aggravated damage over a whole area, weak antagonists, generally massive advantages with few disadvantages). I decided not to support Beast for that reason. It's already been stated that the magic system will become more powerful, and Unleashing from DA: Fae will be included. I hope that the pendulum doesn't swing so far in the other direction that life in the WoD becomes easy for Changelings.</div> </div> </div> </div>Changeling has never been about powergaming. Because of the scarcity of Glamour, it's actually one of the most low-powered games. I think Matt would have a very hard time taking it the other way. But if you look at the list of writers involved, many of them have been with Changeling since at least Second Edition anyway, so I doubt we'll be seeing a vastly different game--just a revised (as in Revised) one with some 20 years of lessons learned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T03:32:26-08:00","id":784630,"title":"","content":"Holden Shearer worked on Cantrips and stuff, and I like his work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10165-flimflamberge","name":"Flimflamberge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10165_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T08:26:30-08:00","id":785400,"title":"","content":"I kicked in my money regardless of delays or keeping to schedule or a manuscript or artwork. The projects need funding to be completed. You wanna see it? Put your money where your nose is - in their business.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid"